  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Dialogue, Mediation and Insider Peace Leadership</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the programme is to improve the conditions for political, peaceful and gender-inclusive transformation of violent conflicts in specific geographic locations through strengthened mediation, negotiation and dialogue processes and enhanced expertise and capacities of third-party actors and insider peace leaders for conflict transformation. The support targets ODA-eligible countries only. Yemen, Ethiopia and Somalia being the main locations.</narrative>
  </description>
